:: Wren Widgets [widget]

<<widget "smuggler_pub_wren">>
<<if (Time.weekDay is 1 or Time.weekDay is 7) and Time.dayState is "dusk">>
	<<link [[Chat (1:00)|Smuggler Pub Wren Chat]]>><<pass 60>><<npcincr Wren love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
	<br>
	<<if $loft_known and !$loft_wren>>
		<<link [[Tell Wren about the orphanage loft|Smuggler Pub Wren Loft]]>><<set $loft_wren to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $loft_wren is 2>>
		<<link [[Ask about the well in the orphanage garden|Smuggler Pub Wren Well]]>><<set $loft_wren to 3>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Leave|Smuggler Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	Wren glances at <<his>> watch. "I fear I must be off. Business calls." <<He>> flashes you a mysterious smile. "See you around."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> winks at you, rises to <<his>> feet, and leaves the pub.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Smuggler Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<</widget>>
